{"input_path": "input/ipas中級_科目2_大數據處理分析與應用_imgs/page_0041.png", "page_index": null, "page_count": null, "width": 2382, "height": 3368, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header", "block_content": "第三章 機率統計基礎", "block_bbox": [294, 208, 817, 261], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[294.0, 208.0], [817.0, 208.0], [817.0, 261.0], [294.0, 261.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 樣本數過少或分佈偏態時，t 檢定可能失準。", "block_bbox": [533, 401, 1581, 465], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[533.0, 401.0], [1581.0, 401.0], [1581.0, 465.0], [533.0, 465.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■顯著性≠實質重要性，建議搭配信賴區間一併報告。", "block_bbox": [532, 501, 1784, 565], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[532.0, 501.0], [1784.0, 501.0], [1784.0, 565.0], [532.0, 565.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "檢定方向（單尾或雙尾）須事先設定，不能事後依結果選擇。", "block_bbox": [533, 601, 1953, 664], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[533.0, 601.0], [1953.0, 601.0], [1953.0, 664.0], [533.0, 664.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "獨立樣本 t 檢定（Independent-samples t-test）", "block_bbox": [401, 701, 1449, 764], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[401.0, 701.0], [1449.0, 701.0], [1449.0, 764.0], [401.0, 764.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "a. 方法概述", "block_bbox": [469, 803, 751, 862], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[469.0, 803.0], [751.0, 803.0], [751.0, 862.0], [469.0, 862.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "獨立樣本 t 檢定用於比較兩組互相獨立樣本的平均數是否具有統計上顯著差異。常見應用情境包括：比較兩種教學法的學習成效、男性與女性的平均工時、兩種產品的顧客滿意度等。", "block_bbox": [534, 902, 2083, 1165], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 902.0], [2083.0, 902.0], [2083.0, 1165.0], [534.0, 1165.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "b. 適用條件與前提假設", "block_bbox": [467, 1202, 1006, 1263], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[467.0, 1202.0], [1006.0, 1202.0], [1006.0, 1263.0], [467.0, 1263.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "兩組資料為獨立樣本（不同個體、不同來源）。", "block_bbox": [534, 1302, 1626, 1363], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 1302.0], [1626.0, 1302.0], [1626.0, 1363.0], [534.0, 1363.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "資料為連續變數。", "block_bbox": [523, 1403, 997, 1462], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[523.0, 1403.0], [997.0, 1403.0], [997.0, 1462.0], [523.0, 1462.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "每組樣本皆來自常態分佈的母體。", "block_bbox": [535, 1503, 1350, 1563], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[535.0, 1503.0], [1350.0, 1503.0], [1350.0, 1563.0], [535.0, 1563.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 母體變異數相等（可用 Levene's test 或 F-test 檢查；若不等應採 Welch's t 檢定）。", "block_bbox": [525, 1601, 2081, 1760], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[525.0, 1601.0], [2081.0, 1601.0], [2081.0, 1760.0], [525.0, 1760.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "c. 假設設定", "block_bbox": [470, 1806, 754, 1865], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[470.0, 1806.0], [754.0, 1806.0], [754.0, 1865.0], [470.0, 1865.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 虛無假設（ $ H_{0} $）： $ \\mu_{1} = \\mu_{2} $（兩組母體平均數無差異）。", "block_bbox": [529, 1900, 1745, 1966], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[529.0, 1900.0], [1745.0, 1900.0], [1745.0, 1966.0], [529.0, 1966.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 對立假設（H $ _{1} $）有三種形式：", "block_bbox": [535, 1999, 1251, 2063], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[535.0, 1999.0], [1251.0, 1999.0], [1251.0, 2063.0], [535.0, 2063.0]]}, {"block_label": "table", "block_content": "<table><tr><td>檢定類型</td><td>對立假設  $ H_{1} $</td><td>適用情境</td></tr><tr><td>雙尾檢定</td><td>$ \\mu_{1} \\neq \\mu_{2} $</td><td>想檢查兩組平均是否不同（不論方向）</td></tr><tr><td>左尾檢定</td><td>$ \\mu_{1} < \\mu_{2} $</td><td>關注第一組是否「低於」第二組</td></tr><tr><td>右尾檢定</td><td>$ \\mu_{1} > \\mu_{2} $</td><td>關注第一組是否「高於」第二組</td></tr></table>", "block_bbox": [307, 2097, 2072, 2450], "block_id": 15, "block_order": null, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[307.0, 2097.0], [2072.0, 2097.0], [2072.0, 2450.0], [307.0, 2450.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "例如：檢驗新藥 A 是否比舊藥 B 有更高的療效，若希望確認 A 是否顯著大於 B，可採右尾檢定。", "block_bbox": [353, 2527, 2080, 2689], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[353.0, 2527.0], [2080.0, 2527.0], [2080.0, 2689.0], [353.0, 2689.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "d. 常見誤用與注意事項", "block_bbox": [467, 2759, 1007, 2819], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[467.0, 2759.0], [1007.0, 2759.0], [1007.0, 2819.0], [467.0, 2819.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 不可將同一組人測前後結果誤用本檢定（應使用成對樣本 t 檢定）。", "block_bbox": [533, 2859, 2067, 2919], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[533.0, 2859.0], [2067.0, 2859.0], [2067.0, 2919.0], [533.0, 2919.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "使用前應先檢查變異數是否相等。", "block_bbox": [534, 2959, 1352, 3020], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 2959.0], [1352.0, 2959.0], [1352.0, 3020.0], [534.0, 3020.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "3-34", "block_bbox": [183, 3189, 283, 3232], "block_id": 20, "block_order": null, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 3189.0], [283.0, 3189.0], [283.0, 3232.0], [183.0, 3232.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"input_path": null, "page_index": null, "boxes": [{"cls_id": 12, "label": "header", "score": 0.8559743762016296, "coordinate": [294, 208, 817, 261], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[294.0, 208.0], [817.0, 208.0], [817.0, 261.0], [294.0, 261.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8490669131278992, "coordinate": [533, 401, 1581, 465], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[533.0, 401.0], [1581.0, 401.0], [1581.0, 465.0], [533.0, 465.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8593153357505798, "coordinate": [532, 501, 1784, 565], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[532.0, 501.0], [1784.0, 501.0], [1784.0, 565.0], [532.0, 565.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8442208170890808, "coordinate": [533, 601, 1953, 664], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[533.0, 601.0], [1953.0, 601.0], [1953.0, 664.0], [533.0, 664.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6746137142181396, "coordinate": [401, 701, 1449, 764], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[401.0, 701.0], [1449.0, 701.0], [1449.0, 764.0], [401.0, 764.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5418789386749268, "coordinate": [469, 803, 751, 862], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[469.0, 803.0], [751.0, 803.0], [751.0, 862.0], [469.0, 862.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9408548474311829, "coordinate": [534, 902, 2083, 1165], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 902.0], [2083.0, 902.0], [2083.0, 1165.0], [534.0, 1165.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.474960058927536, "coordinate": [467, 1202, 1006, 1263], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[467.0, 1202.0], [1006.0, 1202.0], [1006.0, 1263.0], [467.0, 1263.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8491756319999695, "coordinate": [534, 1302, 1626, 1363], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 1302.0], [1626.0, 1302.0], [1626.0, 1363.0], [534.0, 1363.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7789521813392639, "coordinate": [523, 1403, 997, 1462], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[523.0, 1403.0], [997.0, 1403.0], [997.0, 1462.0], [523.0, 1462.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8270914554595947, "coordinate": [535, 1503, 1350, 1563], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[535.0, 1503.0], [1350.0, 1503.0], [1350.0, 1563.0], [535.0, 1563.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.902093231678009, "coordinate": [525, 1601, 2081, 1760], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[525.0, 1601.0], [2081.0, 1601.0], [2081.0, 1760.0], [525.0, 1760.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6339495182037354, "coordinate": [470, 1806, 754, 1865], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[470.0, 1806.0], [754.0, 1806.0], [754.0, 1865.0], [470.0, 1865.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8313575387001038, "coordinate": [529, 1900, 1745, 1966], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[529.0, 1900.0], [1745.0, 1900.0], [1745.0, 1966.0], [529.0, 1966.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.859508752822876, "coordinate": [535, 1999, 1251, 2063], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[535.0, 1999.0], [1251.0, 1999.0], [1251.0, 2063.0], [535.0, 2063.0]]}, {"cls_id": 21, "label": "table", "score": 0.9623727798461914, "coordinate": [307, 2097, 2072, 2450], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[307.0, 2097.0], [2072.0, 2097.0], [2072.0, 2450.0], [307.0, 2450.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9319449663162231, "coordinate": [353, 2527, 2080, 2689], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[353.0, 2527.0], [2080.0, 2527.0], [2080.0, 2689.0], [353.0, 2689.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5148782730102539, "coordinate": [467, 2759, 1007, 2819], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[467.0, 2759.0], [1007.0, 2759.0], [1007.0, 2819.0], [467.0, 2819.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.841469943523407, "coordinate": [533, 2859, 2067, 2919], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[533.0, 2859.0], [2067.0, 2859.0], [2067.0, 2919.0], [533.0, 2919.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8362895250320435, "coordinate": [534, 2959, 1352, 3020], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 2959.0], [1352.0, 2959.0], [1352.0, 3020.0], [534.0, 3020.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7639648914337158, "coordinate": [183, 3189, 283, 3232], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 3189.0], [283.0, 3189.0], [283.0, 3232.0], [183.0, 3232.0]]}]}}